  "rationale": [
    "The original 18-feature representation maps filename-only reading requests, greeting requests, and unsupported instructions without recognized baseline words to the same all-zero vector. No weights or bias over those original features can distinguish that collision.",
    "Weak print/say/display evidence plus weak filename evidence jointly exceed none bias 0.5; either alone stays below it. Existing stronger grep/glob/count evidence remains available unchanged.",
    "New write/create weights and a negative write bias require filename evidence in the supplied ordinary single-verb requests. Edit/replace weights and a negative edit bias likewise require filename evidence, even when both edit and replace occur once without a filename.",
    "Append strongly favors abstention and penalizes both unsupported mutation combinations. A filename alone remains below the none threshold for reading and mutation. The supplied delete request has no positive action cue and therefore abstains.",
